<title>JAPAN: Daido Mutual's bad loans fall to manageable level.</title>
<headline>Daido Mutual's bad loans fall to manageable level.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daido Mutual Insurance Co said on Thursday that it had reduced its bad loans to a manageable level by the end of September.</p>
<p>The statement was made during the announcement of the company's business results for the first half of the 1996/97 business year.</p>
</text>
